  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Education in Emergency through Digital Learning and Food Security for Migrant Children on Thai-Myanmar Border</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&apos;s overall goal is to ensure the continuity of education for migrant children from Myanmar living in Tak Province, Thailand. Through interventions on (1) digital learning aimed at learning recovery and immediate impact, (2) emergency food aid and (3) equipping migrant learning centres with ICT infrastructure and promotion of sanitation, the project will ensure that migrant children have safe, appropriate and inclusive opportunities to continue their learning and reduce the learning loss during the crisis with good health and well-being, mentally and physically.</narrative>
  </description>
